# ACJ SciCalcJava Project

Anitra, Collin and Joe worked to write code for a small app to function as a calculator. 

## Description

Our team built this program to exercise lessons and coding discussed during our first week at Zip Code Wilmington.
Why you used the technologies you used - We were charged with coding a calculator that could execute basic mathematical equations, including squaring and square root functioning.
Initial challenges included, not knowing where or how to start.

